OL,3,AShop freezers in six European countries
OL,4,Ahit by suspected cyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FSabcobel, a Belgian company that
OL,7,Fmanufactures some of the affected
OL,8,Frefrigerators, said the units'
OL,9,Fevaporators were switched to defrost
OL,10,Fmode causing them to warm up, in what
OL,11,Fis believed to be the same method used
OL,12,Fin last month's incident that hit
OL,13,Fhundreds of French supermarkets.
OL,15,FMillions of euros worth of food has had
OL,16,Fto be thrown away, according to local
OL,17,Fmedia reports.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
